        <activityName xml:lang="en">Electronic components, washing machine, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Electronic components, washing machine, at plant
Thie process is based on measurements of the surface of printed wiring boards as well as on the quantity of integrated circuits and on the measurements and amount of passive elements.;
UUID: 01b38117-37b0-311d-8609-6f9286d87759
This process describes the passive elements and printed wiring boards and integrated circuits of a washing machine.
Location: The electronic components are for a Swiss washing machine for a household.
Technology: Electronic components for an actual washing machine for a household.
Time period: Weight and number of elements were collected 2004
Production volume: na
Sampling: unknown 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_01b38117-37b0-311d-8609-6f9286d87759.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
